* P-SSHI COMBINED DEVICE SWEEP
* Union of the ultra-low-power and broader recommended candidate sets.
*
* Set NPN transistor Value to: {npn}
* Set PNP transistor Value to: {pnp}
* Set swept diode Value to:    {Diode}
*
* Sweep size: 9 NPN x 9 PNP x 12 diodes = 972 runs.
* Only ONE set of .step directives is used.

